  {
   "id": "e96537365405",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1165,
   "y": 250,
   "width": 680,
   "height": 175,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 541719408,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2051851967,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1700000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\"Several parts of your swing lined up well with the tour-pro\nrange \u2014 your timing was very close to tour level, and at the\ntop your shoulder turn and shoulder-hip separation were both\nin a normal tour pattern.\n\nThe main difference showed up in how your lower body moved\ntoward the target: your hips opened a lot by impact while\nsliding very little sideways, so your weight moved less\nlaterally than is typical on tour. There are solid pieces\nhere to build on.\"",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "\"Several parts of your swing lined up well with the tour-pro\nrange \u2014 your timing was very close to tour level, and at the\ntop your shoulder turn and shoulder-hip separation were both\nin a normal tour pattern.\n\nThe main difference showed up in how your lower body moved\ntoward the target: your hips opened a lot by impact while\nsliding very little sideways, so your weight moved less\nlaterally than is typical on tour. There are solid pieces\nhere to build on.\"",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 12
  },
  {
   "id": "e93096405361",
